# Accessibility

## Landmarks & semantics

- One `<main>` per page, wrapped around the entire `.page` shell.
- One `<header class="mast">` containing the brand link + `<nav>`. The
  nav gets `aria-label="Primary"`. The active item gets `aria-current="page"`.
- Sidebars are `<aside>` with `aria-label` describing the column ("Site
  index", "Archive index", "Sponsor info").
- Posts use `<article>`. Lists of posts use repeated `<article>` inside a
  `<section aria-label="Latest posts">` (or similar).
- Years on the archive are `<section id="y2026" aria-labelledby="y2026-h">`
  with an `<h2 id="y2026-h">`.
- Dates use `<time datetime="YYYY-MM-DD">`.
- Footer is `<footer class="site-footer">` inside `<main>` (or as the
  page's last child — both are valid; pick one and be consistent).

## Focus & keyboard

- All interactive elements must show a visible focus ring. The default
  browser ring is acceptable; if you customise it, use
  `outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px;`.
- Tab order follows DOM order. Do not introduce `tabindex` other than `-1`
  to remove non-interactive elements from order.
- Skip-to-content link belongs in the very first position inside `<body>`,
  visually hidden until focused. Target: `#main`.

## Color & contrast

The chosen palette has been spot-checked for WCAG AA:

- Body text `#14151a` on `#fafafa` — 17.0:1 ✓
- Meta text `#6b6f78` on `#fafafa` — 5.0:1 ✓ (large/small)
- Muted `#4a4f57` on `#fafafa` — 8.7:1 ✓
- Accent `#d97757` on `#fafafa` — 3.3:1 — passes for **large text and
  non-text UI only**. Do **not** set body copy in accent.
- Accent fg `#ffffff` on `#d97757` — 3.1:1 — minimum for large
  (CTA-hover/sold-week chip is 13px **mono**, which qualifies as large
  per WCAG when bold; the underlying CTA is solid ink, so this only kicks
  in on hover).

If you introduce a new surface that puts small text on accent, switch the
text to `var(--color-bg)` or `#fff` and re-verify contrast.

## Motion

```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
}
```

Already in `tokens.css`. Don't override it.

## Screen reader fixes

- The `★` glyph next to original posts needs `aria-label="Original post"`
  (or wrap in `<span class="sr-only">Original post</span>`). It is
  decorative-with-meaning, so it must be announced.
- The `▮` glyph in the wordmark is purely decorative (`::before`) — no
  label needed; screen readers ignore CSS-generated content.
- The masthead link wrapping the wordmark should set
  `aria-label="ripblog — home"`.
